&lt;p&gt;For more information, please refer to the &lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/blob/main/sdk/azureresiliencemanagement/Azure.ResourceManager.ResilienceManagement/README.md"&gt;README&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
